.970Z","title":"告别戒烟认知误区，拥抱健康无烟生活 | 世界无烟日","subtitle":"","summary":"吸烟对健康的危害早已被科学证实，但许多人因错误观念迟迟不愿迈出戒烟第一步。只有打破这些认识误区，才能真正为健康赢得转机。 误区 吸烟是个人爱好，和吃零食、喝酒一样无可非议，更是我的唯一爱好。 烟草依赖并非普通生活习惯，而","channel":"health","tags":["健康","世界无烟日"],"author":"人民网·健康","source":"人民网·健康","sourceUrl":"http://health.people.com.cn/n1/2025/0531/c14739-40491800.html","cover":"./img/news/a-n_mu4vkevrxqw052-cover.jpg","video":null,"gallery":[],"status":"published","flags":{"headline":false,"hot":false,"blast":false,"focus":false,"top":false,"headlineOrder":0,"recommend":8},"stats":{"views":10,"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"favs":0,"deltaViews":2,"deltaLikes":0},"publishedAt":"2026-09-17T01:05:40.020Z","scheduledAt":"","origin":"pipeline","inboxId":"mu4tvut0djwy9i","channelName":"健康","hasVideo":false,"imageCount":1,"hotScore":0.14},{"id":"n_mu4vkexh8xr14r","createdAt":"2026-09-17T01:52:45.461Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-18T10:01:02.031Z","title":"无糖食品不含糖，多吃不会胖……是真是假？","subtitle":"","summary":"按照《食品安全国家标准 预包装食品标签通则》规定，无糖是指每100克或每100毫升食品中，糖(包括蔗糖、果糖、葡萄糖等)的含量不高于0.5克。因此，无糖不等于绝对不含糖。 无糖食品仍含有碳水化合物、脂肪、蛋白质等供能营养","channel":"health","tags":["健康"],"author":"人民网·健康","source":"人民网·健康","sourceUrl":"http://health.people.com.cn/n1/2025/0601/c14739-40491965.html","cover":"./img/news/a-n_mu4vkexh8xr14r-cover.jpg","video":null,"gallery":[],"status":"published","flags":{"headline":false,"hot":false,"blast":false,"focus":false,"top":false,"headlineOrder":0,"recommend":8},"stats":{"views":1,"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"favs":0,"deltaViews":0,"deltaLikes":0},"publishedAt":"2026-09-17T01:05:40.016Z","scheduledAt":"","origin":"pipeline","inboxId":"mu4tvusw68k9m8","channelName":"健康","hasVideo":false,"imageCount":1,"hotScore":0.08},{"id":"n_mu4vkez9tai16z","createdAt":"2026-09-17T01:52:45.525Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-18T10:01:02.031Z","title":"广东试点“疫苗处方” 把预防接种融入日常诊疗","subtitle":"","summary":"广东今年试点“疫苗处方”，广州市海珠区是该省首个实现全区推广的行政区。 该区疾控中心副主任朱凯星30日表示，全域推行“疫苗处方”服务1个月以来，居民接种便利性提升，疫苗可预防传染病发病率有所下降，将鼓励各试点单位积极探索","channel":"health","tags":["健康"],"author":"人民网·健康","source":"人民网·健康","sourceUrl":"http://health.people.com.cn/n1/2025/0601/c14739-40491964.html","cover":"./img/news/a-n_mu4vkez9tai16z-cover.jpg","video":null,"gallery":[],"status":"published","flags":{"headline":false,"hot":false,"blast":false,"focus":false,"top":false,"headlineOrder":0,"recommend":8},"stats":{"views":3,"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"favs":0,"deltaViews":0,"deltaLikes":0},"publishedAt":"2026-09-17T01:05:40.013Z","scheduledAt":"","origin":"pipeline","inboxId":"mu4tvust4arydq","channelName":"健康","hasVideo":false,"imageCount":1,"hotScore":0.09},{"id":"n_mu4vkf14m5dxga","createdAt":"2026-09-17T01:52:45.592Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-18T10:01:02.031Z","title":"专家：只靠意志力戒烟太难，需掌握科学方法","subtitle":"","summary":"5月31日是第38个世界无烟日。日前发布的2024中国成人烟草调查结果显示，中国15岁及以上人群吸烟率为23.2%。 在许多烟民眼中，戒烟是一件需要“钢铁意志力”的事，过程痛苦且漫长。什么原因导致戒烟困难？如何才能科学戒","channel":"health","tags":["健康","专家"],"author":"人民网·健康","source":"人民网·健康","sourceUrl":"http://health.people.com.cn/n1/2025/0601/c14739-40491967.html","cover":"./img/news/a-n_mu4vkf14m5dxga-cover.jpg","video":null,"gallery":[],"status":"published","flags":{"headline":false,"hot":false,"blast":false,"focus":false,"top":false,"headlineOrder":0,"recommend":8},"stats":{"views":1,"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"favs":0,"deltaViews":0,"deltaLikes":0},"publishedAt":"2026-09-17T01:05:40.010Z","scheduledAt":"","origin":"pipeline","inboxId":"mu4tvusqw4s0wz","channelName":"健康","hasVideo":false,"imageCount":1,"hotScore":0.08},{"id":"n_mu4vkgpn8c552k","createdAt":"2026-09-17T01:52:47.771Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-18T10:01:02.031Z","title":"蚊子最喜欢O型血？错错错 这七类人在它们眼里才是“真香”","subtitle":"","summary":"夏季气温高、雨水多 蚊子也开始整夜“嗡嗡嗡” 一晚上被叮好几个“包” 痒得人根本睡不着！ 什么人容易招蚊子？ 如何有效止痒？ 小编为你划重点，快快收藏↓ 真有“招蚊体质”吗？ 这7类人群确实更容易招蚊子！ 有传言说“蚊子","channel":"health","tags":["健康","蚊子最喜欢O型血","错错错"],"author":"人民网·健康","source":"人民网·健康","sourceUrl":"http://health.people.com.cn/n1/2025/0601/c14739-40492041.html","cover":"./img/news/a-n_mu4vkgpn8c552k-cover.jpg","video":null,"gallery":[